OL,3,GNEWSAPolice given temporary dispersal
OL,4,Apowers ahead of protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemporary police powers have been put
OL,7,Fin place to enforce a dispersal zone
OL,8,Fand ban on face coverings ahead of a
OL,9,Fplanned protest.
OL,11,FAvon and Somerset Police authorised the
OL,12,Fpowers from 16:00 BST until 23:00 for a
OL,13,Fplanned protest and counter-protest in
OL,14,FBristol city centre. Those who fail to
OL,15,Fcomply with the restrictions could be
OL,16,Farrested and prosecuted, the force
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FOfficers will be on site to tell people
OL,20,Fabout the restrictions, "to enable
OL,21,Frights to freedom of expression and
OL,22,Fassembly" and for "safeguarding".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
