OL,3,GNEWSAPolice given temporary dispersal
OL,4,Apowers ahead of protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Keith Smith said: "People are
OL,7,Ffree to express their views lawfully,
OL,8,Fbut anyone who crosses the line into
OL,9,Fcriminality should not mistake a lack
OL,10,Fof immediate arrest for a lack of
OL,11,Faction."
